<title>USA: Ocal sets stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Ocal sets stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>VAN NUYS, Calif. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ocal Inc Tuesday said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of $500,000 of common stock from time to time in the open market.</p>
<p>Ocal was up 1/4 to 3-7/8.</p>
</text>
